## EXPERIMENTAL METHODS
Reagents and material. Gold chloride $\mathrm{(HAuCl_{4})}$ and hexanethiol $96\%$ , HT) were purchased from Sigma-Aldrich Chemical Co. (St. Louis, USA). Polyvinylpyrrolidone K30 (PVP), dopamine (DA), glucose, N,N-dimethylformamide (DMF), ethanol and sodium borohydride $\mathrm{(NaBH_{4})}$ ) were purchased from Ke Long Chemical Co. (Chengdu, China). Copper nitrate-trihydrate $(\mathrm{Cu}(\mathsf{N O}_{3})_{2})$ and 2-amino terephthalic acid $\mathrm{NH}_{2}$ -BDC) were obtained from Qiang Shun Chemical Co. (Shanghai, China). Trishydroxymethylaminomethane hydrochloride (Tris-HCl) was supplied by F. Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd. (Basel, Switzerland). Phi29 DNA polymerase (containing reaction buffer for phi29 catalyzed polymerization, donated as phi29 buffer), deoxynucleotide solution mixture (dNTPs), nicking endonuclease (N.BstNBI) were purchased from New England Biolabs Co., Ltd. (Ipswich, USA). $1{\times}\mathrm{NEB}$ buffer (containing $50~\mathrm{mM}$ Tris-HCl, 10 mM MgCl2, 100 mM NaCl, 1 mM
