DTT, $\mathrm{pH}\ 7.5\rangle$ ) was used as the supporting buffer of N.BstNBI in this work. Hairpin probes 1 (HP1) were obtained from TaKaRa Biotechnology Co., Ltd. (Dalian, China), ferrocene labeled hairpin probes 2 (Fc-HP2), primer and hairpin probes 3 (HP3) were purchased from Sangon Biotechnology Co., Ltd. (Shanghai, China). $20~\mathrm{mM}$ Tris-HCl buffer $\mathrm{(pH~}7.5)$ containing 140 mM NaCl, $\mathrm{1\mM\MgCl_{2}}$ and 5 mM KCl was used as detection buffer in the experiments. Deionized water was used throughout this study. All the sequences of the HPLC-purified DNA oligonucleotides were listed as follows:
