Fc-HP2: $5^{\prime}$ -SH- $(\mathrm{CH}_{2})_{6}$ -AGAAGGGCAGAGTCCTTCTGCCC-Fc-3′ Primer: $5^{\prime}$ -GCCTCCTT- $3^{\prime}$
