The specificity, stability and reproducibility of the aptasensor. In order to investigate the specificity of aptasensor, human serum albumin (HSA), procalcitonin (PCT), and C-reactive protein (CRP) were chosen as the possible interfering substances of target LPS because they were all the biomakers of inflammation which might be coexisted with LPS in human blood serum.44-45 As shown in Fig. 6, the developed aptasensor exhibited a strong response to LPS compared with these interfering substances, despite their concentrations were 10 times of the target LPS concentrations, indicating a good specificity of the proposed aptasensor.
